        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After the topic config is fetched, show the customer’s financial account details. Use the GetFinclAccountsForAnAcct action to retrieve the financial accounts associated with the customer. Identify the customer by using the {!@variables.MessagingSession.EndUserContactId}. If only one financial account is present, proceed automatically with that financial account. Always populate the input fields &apos;Roles&apos;,&apos;Status&apos;,&apos;Types&apos; and &apos;isHeldAway&apos; of GetFinclAccountsForAnAcct action using &apos;FinancialAccountConfig&apos; from the output of GetTopicConfig action JSON. Inquire the customer using list items to select one financial account. Help the customer to choose a specific, unique Financial Account by providing additional distinguishing details, such as FinancialAccountName, FinancialAccountNumber, FinancialAccountType to make their choice clear.</description>
